    "body": "Yeah, indeed, I think capturing the precise semantics without using tombstones would be a *huge* burden.\r\n\r\nMy inclination is to specify that lists and maps can have holes, but they're automatically skipped over by all spec-author-facing operations; only the list/map iteration internal algo sees them.",
