    "updated_at": "2022-05-09T11:10:46Z",
    "body": "I wonder to what extent we should give advice here to implementations as not all lists will need this complexity. I wonder if we can do similar things to \"ASCII string\" whereby we essentially assert the thing will have a subset of the total semantics.",
